# Template for web/.env (git-ignored). Settings for the dev server (npm run dev, npm run preview), read by
# vite.config.ts in Node. The browser code reads no variables from here: it calls the API on its own origin.
# Never put a secret in a VITE_ variable: those would reach the browser code, which anyone can read.

# Where the backend runs. The dev server forwards /api/v1/... there, so the web app and the API share one origin.
# Leave unset for http://127.0.0.1:8000 (where .\run.ps1 starts it).
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8001
